post.description:
Example configuration for `for_variants` scope type:

```
{
    "type": "for_variants",
    "configuration": {
        "variants": [
            "string"
        ]
    }
}
```

Example configuration for `percentage_discount` action type:

```
{
    "type": "percentage_discount",
    "configuration": {
        "amount": float
    }
}
```

